<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  暫時性檔案:Ozakboy.Http 0.3.3 發佈到 nuget.org 之後請刪除本檔(連同 .gitignore 裡 /.nuget-packages/ 那一行)。
  TEMPORARY: delete this file (and the /.nuget-packages/ line in .gitignore) once Ozakboy.Http 0.3.3 is published
  to nuget.org.

  本套件 0.2.1 需要 Ozakboy.Http 0.3.3 的修正(簽章關閉的管線也把 WithQueryParameters 的參數寫進位址),
  而那一版尚未發佈,只以 dotnet pack 產在本機 feed。沒有這份設定,還原會找不到 0.3.3 而整個 repo 建置不起來。
  This package's 0.2.1 needs the fix in Ozakboy.Http 0.3.3 (a pipeline with signing switched off also writes
  WithQueryParameters into the URI), which is not published yet and exists only as a local pack. Without this file
  the restore cannot find 0.3.3 and the repo does not build.

  clear 是必要的:沒有它,機器層級的 NuGet.config 仍然生效,而本機 feed 只是「多一個來源」——
  那在本機看起來沒問題,到了 CI 就變成「找不到套件」,而且原因藏在一層看不見的全域設定裡。
  The clear matters: without it the machine-level configuration still applies and the local feed is merely one
  more source, which looks fine locally and becomes a missing package on CI for a reason hidden in a global file.
-->
<configuration>
  <packageSources>
    <clear />
    <add key="nuget.org" value="https://api.nuget.org/v3/index.json" />
    <add key="ozakboy-local" value="D:\程式專案\Ozakboy_GitHub\nuget-local-feed" />
  </packageSources>

  <!--
    還原目的地改到 repo 底下的 .nuget-packages(已進 .gitignore),不用使用者層級的全域快取。
    原因是本機 feed 的 0.3.3 在發佈前可能重新打包,而全域快取的鍵只有「套件 id + 版號」——
    同一個版號重新打包之後,快取裡留的還是舊那一份,還原不會察覺,於是建置用的是上一次的內容,
    而錯誤會出現在「明明改了卻沒生效」這種最難懷疑到快取的地方。
    改到 repo 底下之後,這份快取跟著這個暫時狀態一起存在,也跟著一起消失。
    Restore targets a repo-local .nuget-packages (git-ignored) instead of the user-wide global cache, because the
    local feed's 0.3.3 may be repacked before it is published and the global cache is keyed on package id and
    version alone: repacking the same version leaves the old copy in place, restore does not notice, and the build
    silently uses the previous content — a failure that looks like "the edit did not take effect" and points
    nowhere near a cache. A repo-local folder lives and dies with this temporary arrangement.

    0.3.3 發佈之後連同本檔一起刪除,還原就會回到正常的全域快取。
    Delete this file once 0.3.3 is published and restore returns to the normal global cache.
  -->
  <config>
    <add key="globalPackagesFolder" value=".nuget-packages" />
  </config>
</configuration>
